      null,
      "<div><b><br></b><b>For additional information on the equipment available, please read the &gt;&gt; <a href=\"https://mediadiplomaworld.wixsite.com/diploma/equipment-guide\">Equipment Guide</a> &lt;&lt;</b><b></b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div><b>You must carefully read the info below and check that you understand before booking.</b></div><div><br></div><div><ol><li>You must have signed and returned an <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/187EX-TVw75GRSJbhq_NIVBUCbmlbIr1Y/\">OFF-SITE PERMISSION FORM</a> to take equipment off-site.<br><br></li><li>Book<b> at least 24 hours in advance</b> wherever possible - the cut-off time for prebooking is <b>4:10pm the day before. <br><br></b></li><li>Bookings are <b>not guaranteed</b> due to limited equipment: it's a booking <i>request </i>not<i> guarantee.<b> <br><br></b></i></li><li>Please make sure to return equipment at the time and date you have filled out in the form; we use the <b>DAY/MONTH/YEAR date system. <br><br></b></li><li>Equipment is only allowed out for <b>one night at a time</b>, to be returned <b>no later than 10:45am the following day</b>, or<b> </b>over <b>one weekend</b> (Friday - Monday, returned no later than 10:45am). Please plan your filming accordingly.<br><br></li><li>Bookings are during term-time only, and are<b> not permitted over half term or holidays.<br><br></b></li><li>Do not leave equipment unattended or with another student.<b> When signed out under your name, you are responsible for the equipment. </b><span><br><br></span></li><li>We operate a <b>THREE STRIKE SYSTEM</b> - Abandoning equipment, damaging equipment, no-shows and late returns without communication or good reason (<i>e.g. being off sick</i>) will result in a warning or strike.<br><br></li><li><b>Any lost or damaged equipment must be reported as soon as it is noticed</b>, or at the earliest convenience if it occurs while off-site - this includes by email, Teams message, or in-person either at the equipment hatch or in class.</li></ol></div><div><div><div>       <br></div><div><div>=========================================================================</div><div><br></div><div><div>Please, email<b> <a href=\"mailto:mediatech@longroad.ac.uk\">mediatech@longroad.ac.uk</a></b> if you have any questions or problems, need to arrange an alternative pick-up time, or will be late returning equipment. <b>You MUST contact the Media Technician if you will be late returning, as this may affect equipment availability for other students.</b></div></div></div></div><div><ul><li>To book the <b>Photography Studio</b>, please contact the Media Technician to check for availability<br><br></li><li>To book a <b>classroom</b> please contact Student Services or visit Reception to find a vacant room<br><br></li><li>To use a <b>Performing Arts room</b>, please email the Performing Arts Technician, Amal: <a href=\"http://akurianjoseph@longroad.ac.uk\">akurianjoseph@longroad.ac.uk</a></li></ul></div></div>"
